分析下面两段代码：

```java
for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {
    int j = 1;
    while (j < n) { work(); j *= 2; }
}

int f(int n) {
    if (n <= 1) return 1;
    return f(n/2) + f(n/2) + n;
}
```

